# Ghostly Dancers, Eerie: "Whenever an enchantment you control enters and whenever you fully unlock a Room, create a 3/1 white
# Spirit creature token with flying." Turn 1 Bot1 casts Dancers: no enchantment card in its graveyard and no Room, so neither
# option of its enters ability can be done and nothing happens. Bot2's Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber entering on turn 2 and fully
# unlocked on turn 4 (an enchantment and a Room Bot1 does not control) make nothing. Bot1's own Annex entering on turn 3 makes one
# Spirit (the Dancers' own entering made none: it was not on the battlefield to see it, and it is no enchantment), and unlocking
# Ritual Chamber on turn 5 (CR 709.5i) makes another, besides the Demon of the door itself.

